### 1. OrderControllerBranchTest.java
**Path**: `order-service/src/test/java/com/fooddelivery/order/controller/OrderControllerBranchTest.java`

**Purpose**: Cover all missed branches in OrderController.java

**Tests Added** (7 tests):
- ✅ `createOrder_NullTotalWithItems_ShouldCalculateTotal()` - Covers line 53 TRUE path (totalAmount calculation)
- ✅ `createOrder_WithTotalAmountSet_ShouldNotRecalculate()` - Covers line 53 FALSE path (skip calculation)
- ✅ `updateOrder_NotFound()` - Covers lines 105-124 orElse (Optional.empty())
- ✅ `updateOrder_NullItems_CopiesExisting()` - Covers lines 113-118 FALSE (null orderItems)
- ✅ `updateOrder_WithItems_SetsReference()` - Covers lines 113-118 TRUE (orderItems present)
- ✅ `deleteOrder_NotFound()` - Covers line 129 FALSE (order not found)
- ✅ `updateOrderStatus_NotFound()` - Covers lines 164-172 orElse (Optional.empty())

**Key Features**:
- Uses `@WebMvcTest(OrderController.class)` for proper Spring MVC testing
- Mocks `OrderService` with `@MockBean`
- Uses `MockMvc` for HTTP request simulation
- Properly mocks `Optional.empty()` scenarios for 404 responses
- Tests both TRUE and FALSE branches of conditional logic

