### Option 3: Refactor Total Calculation

**Extract method**:
```java
@PostMapping
public ResponseEntity&lt;Order&gt; createOrder(@Valid @RequestBody OrderRequest request) {
 Order order = new Order();
 // ... existing code ...

 if (order.getTotalAmount() == null &amp;&amp; order.getOrderItems() != null) {
 order.setTotalAmount(calculateOrderTotal(order.getOrderItems()));
 }
}

// NEW METHOD - easier to test
private BigDecimal calculateOrderTotal(List&lt;OrderItem&gt; items) {
 return items.stream()
 .map(i -&gt; i.getPrice().multiply(BigDecimal.valueOf(i.getQuantity())))
 .reduce(BigDecimal.ZERO, BigDecimal::add);
}
```

**Test the extracted method**:
```java
