## Critical Discovery: The Unreachable Branch

### Code Analysis

**OrderController.java - createOrder() method flow**:

```java
27: Order order = new Order(); // totalAmount = null (default)
28: order.setId(null);
29: order.setUserId(request.getUserId());
30: order.setRestaurantId(request.getRestaurantId());
