```

### The Smoking Gun

**OrderRequest DTO does NOT have a `totalAmount` field**:

```java
public class OrderRequest {
 @NotNull(message = "User ID is required")
 private Long userId;

 @NotNull(message = "Restaurant ID is required")
 private Long restaurantId;

